title: Significant Deflation
tags: event
view-if: flag_deflation  = 1
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: flag_deflation = 0; deflation_ticker_timer = 12; rural_rep -= 2; rural_dem += 2; conservative_dissent -= 1; radical_dissent += 2

= Prices Are Falling

With the money supply tightening and credit growing scarce, prices across the country have begun to fall. Farmers find their debts effectively larger even as their crops sell for less. Wall Street investments lose value by the week, and the wealthy men who hold them are demanding that Washington do something before the losses spread further.